        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DRB4004BRPSG, Contemporary Sliding Pocket Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNormally used or hallway or closet doors, the Contemporary Pocket Door Passage Set includes 1 flush pull that wraps around both sides of the door with an attached edge pull. The edge pull flips out so you can pull a sliding door out of a pocket. It available to fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors. The Darby is available in an array of high-quality finishes. This Modern Pocket Door Passage Set has a depth of 1/4 inches where your fingers fit into the pull.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Contemporary Style Pocket Locks are also available as a <a href=\"/products/contemporary-pocket-door-privacy-lock-first-impressions-drb4004brpvc\"><b>Privacy Lock Set</b></a> and a <a href=\"/products/contemporary-pocket-door-flush-pull-first-impressions-drb4004004br\"><b>Flush Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions DRB4004BRPSG Darby Collection Contemporary Pocket Door Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\".</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DRB05-specifications.pdf?v=1704262225\"><b>First Impressions DRB4004BRPSG Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged as a set that includes 2 flush pulls, flip out edge pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
