                "title": "Contemporary Pocket Door Passage Set | Modern Pocket Door Passage Set",
                "description": "Normally used or hallway or closet doors, the Contemporary Pocket Door Passage Set includes 1 flush pull that wraps around both sides of the door with an attached edge pull. The edge pull flips out so you can pull a sliding door out of a pocket. It available to fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors. The Darby is available in an array of high-quality finishes. This Modern Pocket Door Passage Set has a depth of 1/4 inches where your fingers fit into the pull.\r\n",
